#!/bin/sh
# about: Open checkboxes from your todo.md
# group: System
# Unchecked "- [ ]" items from ~/.config/halftone/todo.md (created with an example if missing).
f="$HOME/.config/halftone/todo.md"
echo "title: Todo"; echo "every: 10"
[ -f "$f" ] || { mkdir -p "$HOME/.config/halftone"; printf '# todo\n- [ ] edit ~/.config/halftone/todo.md\n- [ ] ask Claude to add a module\n- [x] install halftone\n' > "$f"; }
echo "open: open '$f'"
n=$(grep -c '^[[:space:]]*- \[ \]' "$f")
[ "$n" -eq 0 ] && { echo "text: all done"; exit 0; }
echo "big: $n to do"
grep '^[[:space:]]*- \[ \]' "$f" | sed 's/^[[:space:]]*- \[ \] *//' | head -8 | sed 's/^/text: · /'
exit 0
